  "body": "## Result and review\nA perimeter formula proves k405 for even least-period, distinct-vertex billiard polygons with a nondegenerate nested confocal elliptical caustic. Separate full review passed, including first variation, finite-circle-action symmetry and exact six-bounce checks. 686,292 author and 12,846 independent controls pass. The earlier k603 chord lemma is credited. Repeated odd polygons and hyperbolic caustics are outside this stated scope; priority is unconfirmed.\n\nAll listed independent review files are retained unchanged.\n\n## Queue\nRecommended claimed_solved 2/5. Campaign coordinator will add the corresponding QUEUE.md row update to this branch.\n\nNo new human peer-review claim, merge or release requested.\n",
